CASE CHAIN   PASS   6
CASE CHAR    PASS   8
POINTERS     PASS   5
INDEXES      PASS   4
COPY         PASS   4
REAL         PASS   8
MUL CONST    PASS   5
TOTAL PASS 49 FAIL 0
